9:
Ndipo anati:
Ayamikike Yehova, Mulungu wa Semu;
Kanani akhale kapolo wace.

25:
Yehova ndipo anati kwa iye,
Mitundu iwiri iri m'mimba mwako,
Magulu awiri a anthu adzaturuka m'mimba mwako;
Gulu lina lidzapambana mphamvu ndi linzace;
Wamkuru adzakhala kapolo wa wamng'ono.

27:
Ndipo anasendera nampsompsona; ndipo anamva kununkhira kwa zobvala zace, namdalitsa, nati,
Taona, kununkhira kwa mwana wanga,
Kufanana ndi kununkhira kwa munda anaudalitsa Yehova;

Mlungu akupatse iwe mame a kumwamba,
Ndi zonenepa za dziko lapansi,
Ndi tirigu wambiri ndi vinyo;

Anthu akutumikire iwe,
Mitundu ikuweramire iwe;
Ucite ufumu pa abale ako,
Ana a amako akuweramire iwe;
Wotemberereka ali yense akutemberera iwe,
Wodalitsika ali yense akudalitsa iwe.

Ndipo Isake atate wace anayankha nati kwa iye,
Taona, pokhala pako mpa zonenepa za dziko lapansi,
Mpa mame a kumwamba akudzera komwe;

Udzakhala ndi moyo ndi lupanga lako, nudzakhala kapolo wamphwako;
Ndipo padzakhalapamene udzapulumuka,
Udzacotsa gori lace pakhosi pako.

49:
Wobwabwada ngati madzi; sudzapambana;
Cifukwa unakwera pa kama wa atate wako;
Pamenepo unaipitsapo; anakwera paja ndigonapo.

Mtima wangawe, usalowe mu ciungwe cao;
Ulemerero wanga, usadziphatike pa masonkhano ao;
Cifukwa m'kukwiya kwao anapha munthu,
M'kufuna kwao anapundula ng'ombe.

Kutembereredwekukwiyakwao, cifukwa kunali koopsya;
Ndi kupsya mtima kwao, cifukwa kunali kwankharwe;
Ndidzawagawanitsa m'Yakobo
Ndidzabalalitsa iwo m'Israyeli.

Yuda, abale ako adzakuyamika iwe;
Dzanja lako lidzakhala pa khosi la adani ako;
Ana amuna a atate wako adzakuweramira.

Zebuloni adzakhala m'doko la kunyanja;
Ndipo iye adzakhala doko la ngalawa;
Ndipo malire ace adakhala pa Zidoni.

Yosefe ndi nthambi yobala,
Nthambi yobala pambali pa kasupe;
Nthambi zace ziyangayanga palinga.

Benjamini ndiye mmbulu wakulusalusa;
M'mamawa adzadya comotola,
Madzulo adzagawa zofunkha.

15:
Nyimbo yolemekeza Mulungu, Pamenepo Mose ndi ana a Israyeli anayimbira Yehova nyimbo iyi, nanena, ndi kuti,
Ndidzayimbira Yehova pakuti wapambanatu;
Kavalo ndi wokwera wace anawaponya m'nyanja.

Ndipondi mpumo wa m'mphuno mwanu madzi anaunjikika,
Mayendedwe ace anakhala ciriri ngati mulu;
Zozama zinalimba m'kati mwa nyanja.

Mdani anati,
Ndiwalondola, ndiwakumika, ndidzagawa zofunkha;
Ndidzakhuta nao mtima;
Ndidzasolola lupanga langa, dzanja langa lidzawaononga.

Pamenepo mafumu a Edomu anadabwa;
Agwidwa nako kunthunthumira amphamvu a ku Moabu;
Okhala m'Kanani onse asungunukamtima.

Kuopa kwakukuru ndi mantha ziwagwera;
Pa dzanja lanu lalikuru akhala cete ngati mwala;
Kufikira apita anthu anu, Yehova,
Kufikira apita anthu amene mudawaombola.

21:
Cifukwa cace, ananena m'buku la Nkhondo za Yehova,
Vahebi m'Sufa,
Ndi miyendo ya Arinoni;

Citsime adakumba mafumu,
Adacikonza omveka a anthu;
Atanena mlamuli, ndi ndodo zao.
Ndipo atacoka kucipululu anamuka ku Matana;

23:
Ndipo ananena fanizo lace, nati,
Ukani, Balaki, imvani;
Ndimvereni, mwana wa Zipori;

Mulungu sindiye munthu, kuti aname;
Kapena mwana wa munthu, kuti aleke;
Kodi anena, osacita?

24:
Pamenepo ananena fanizo lace, nati,
Balamu mwana wa Beori anenetsa,
Ndi munthuyo anatsinzina maso anenetsa;

Mulungu amturutsa m'Aigupto;
Ali nayo mphamvu yonga ya njati;
Adzawadya amitundu, ndiwo adani ace.
Nadzaphwanya mafupa ao, Ndi kuwapyoza ndi mibvi yace.

Ndipo ananena fanizo lace, nati,
Balamu mwana wa Beori anenetsa,
Ndi munthu wotsinzina masoyo anenetsa;

Koma Israyeli adzacita zamphamvu.
Ndipo wina woturuka m'Yakobo adzacita ufumu;
Nadzapasula otsalira m'mudzi.

Ndipo anayang'ana ku Amaleki, nanena fanizo lace, nati,
Amaleki ndiye woyamba wa amitundu;
Koma citsiriziro cace, adzaonongeka ku nthawi zonse.

32:
Ciphunzitso canga cikhale ngati mvula;
Maneno anga agwe ngati mame;
Ngati mvula yowaza pamsipu,
Ndi monga madontho a mvula pazitsamba.

Thanthwe, nchito yace ndi yangwiro;
Pakuti njira zace zonse ndi ciweruzo;
Mulungu wokhulupirika ndi wopanda cisalungamo;
Iye ndiye wolungama ndi wolunjika,

Kumbukirani masiku akale,
Zindikirani zaka za mibadwo yambiri;
Funsani atate wanu, adzakufotokozerani;
Akuru anu, adzakuuzani.

Anampeza m'dziko la mabwinja, ndi m'cipululu colira copanda kanthu;
Anamzinga, anamlangiza,
Anamsunga ngati kamwana lea m'diso;

Anamuyendetsa pa misanje ya dziko lapansi,
Ndipo anadya zipatso za m'minda;
Namyamwitsa uci wa m'thanthwe,
Ndi mafutam'mwala wansangalabwe;

Koma Yesuruni anasanduka wonenepa, natazira;
Wasanduka wonenepa, wakula, wakuta ndi mafuta;
Pamenepo anasiya Mulungu amene anamlenga,
Napeputsa thanthwe la cipulumutso cace.

Anaziphera nsembe ziwanda, si ndizo Mulungu ai;
Milungu yosadziwa iwo,
Yatsopano yofuma pafupi, Imene makolo anu sanaiopa,

Anautsa nsanje yanga ndi cinthu cosati Mulungu;
Anautsa mkwiyo wanga om zopanda pace zao.
Ndidzautsa nsanje yao ndi iwo osakhala mtundu wa anthu;
Ndidzautsa mkwiyo wao ndi mtundu wa anthu opusa.

Tapenyani tsopano kuti Ine ndine iye,
Ndipo palibe mulungu koma Ine;
Ndipha Ine, ndikhalitsanso ndi mayo:
Ndikantha, ndicizanso Ine;
Ndipo palibe wakulanditsa m'dzanja langa.

33:
Ndipo anati,
Yehova anafuma ku Sinai,
Nawaturukiraku Seiri;
Anaoneka wowala pa phiri la Parana,
Anafumira kwa opatulika zikwi zikwi;
Ku dzanja lamanja lace kudawakhalira lamulo lamoto.

Inde akonda mitundu ya anthu;
Opatulidwa ace onse ali m'dzanjamwanu;
Ndipo akhala pansi ku mapazi anu;
Yense adzalandirako mau anu.

Za Yuda ndi izi; ndipo anati,
Imvani, Yehova, mau a Yuda,
Ndipo mumfikitse kwa anthu ace;
Manja ace amfikire;
Ndipo mukhale inu thandizo lace pa iwo akumuukira.

Amene anati za atate wace ndi amai wace, Sindinamuone;
Sanazindikira abale ace,
Sanadziwa ana ace omwe;
Popeza anasamalira mau anu, Nasunga cipangano canu.

Ndipo za Yosefe anati,
Yehova adalitse dziko lace;
Ndi zinthu zofunikatu za m'mwamba, ndi mame,
Ndi madzi okhala pansipo;

Woyamba kubadwa wa ng'ombe yace, ulemerero ndi wace;
Nyanga zace ndizo nyanga zanjati;
Adzatunga nazo mitundu ya anthu pamodzi, kufikira malekezero a dziko lapansi.
Iwo ndiwo zikwi khumi za Efraimu,
Iwo ndiwo zikwi za Manase.

Ndi za Zebuloni anati,
Kondwera, Zebuloni, ndi kuturukakwako;
Ndi Isakara, m'mahema mwako.

Adzaitana mitundu ya anthu afike kuphiri;
Apo adzaphera nsembe za cilungamo;
Popeza adzayamwa zocuruka za m'nyanja,
Ndi cuma cobisika mumcenga.

Ndipo Israyeli akhala mokhazikika pa yekha;
Kasupe wa Yakobo;
Akhala m'dziko la tirigu ndi vinyo;
Inde thambo lace likukha mame.

5:
Imvani mafumu inu; cherani makutu, akalonga inu;
Ndidzayimbira ine Yehova, inetu;
Ndidzamuyimbira nyimbo, Yehova, Mulungu wa Israyeli,

Galamuka, Debora, galamuka,
Galamuka, galamuka, unene nyimbo;
Uka, Baraki, manga nsinga ndende zako, mwana wa Abinoamu, iwe.

Pa mapazi ace anabzong'onyoka, anagwa, anagona;
Pa mapazi ace anabzong'onyoka, anagwa;
Pobzong'onyokapo, pamenepo wagwa wafa.

2:
Ndipo Hana anapemphera, nati
Mtima wanga umyuka mokondwera kwa Yehova,
Nyanga yanga yakwezeka mwa Yehova;
Pakamwa panga pakula kwa adani anga;
Popeza ndikondwera m'cipulumutsocanu.

Palibe wina woyera ngati Yehova;
Palibe wina koma Inu nokha;
Palibenso thanthwe longa Mulungu wathu.

Musalankhulenso modzikuza kwambiri motero;
M'kamwa mwanu musaturuke zolulutsa;
Cifukwa Yehova ali Mulungu wanzeru,
Ndipo iye ayesa zocita anthu.

Amene anakhuta anakasuma cakudya;
Koma anjalawo anacira;
Inde cumba cabala asanu ndi awiri:
Ndipo iye amene ali ndi ana ambiri acita liwondewonde.

Amuutsa waumphawi m'pfumbi,
Nanyamula wosowa padzala,
Kukamkhalitsa kwa akalonga;
Ndi kuti akhale naco colowa ca cimpando ca ulemerero;
Cifukwa nsanamira za dziko lapansi nza Yehova,
Ndipo iye anakhazika dziko pa izo,

Adzasunga mapazi a okoodedwaace,
Koma oipawo adzawakhalitsa cete mumdima;
Pakuti palibe munthu adzapambana ndi mphamvu,

1:
Ndipsinjika mtima cifukwa ca iwe, mbale wanga Jonatani;
Wandikomera kwambiri;
Cikondi cako, ndinadabwa naco,
Cinaposa cikondi ca anthu akazi.

3:
Manja anu sanamangidwa, mapazi anu sanalongedwa m'zigologolo;
Monga munthu wakugwa ndi anthu oipa momwemo mudagwa inu.
Ndipo anthu onse anamliranso.

22:
Mulungu wa thanthwe langa, Iye ndidzamkhulupirira;
Cikopa canga, ndi nyanga ya cipulumutso canga, nsanja yanga yaitali, ndi populumukirapo panga;
Mpulumutsi wanga, mundipulumutsa kuciwawa.

M'mphuno mwace munaturuka utsi,
Ndi moto woturuka m'kamwa mwace unaononga;
Makala anayaka nao.

Inunso munandipulumutsa ine pa kulimbana kwa anthu anga;
Munandisunga ndikhale mutu wa amitundu;
Anthu amene sindinawadziwa adzanditsumikira ine.

Amene anditurutsa kwa adani anga;
Inde mundikweza ine pamwamba pa iwo akundiukira;
Mundipulumutsa kwa munthu waciwawa.

Iye apatsa mfumu yace cipulumutso cacikuru;
Naonetsera cifundo wodzozedwa wace,
Kwa Davide ndi mbeu yace ku nthawi zonse.

23:
Mulungu wa Israyeli anati,
Thanthwe la Israyeli Gnalankhula ndi ine;
Kudzakhala woweruza anthu molungama;
Woweruza m'kuopa Mulungu.

Zoonadi nyumba yanga siikhala yotere ndi Mulungu;
Koma iye anapangana ndi ine pangano losatha,
Lolongosoka mwa zonse ndi losungika;
Pakuti ici ndi cipulumutso canga conse, ndi kufuma kwanga konse,
Kodi sadzacimeretsa?

16:
Mcitireni Yehova ulemerero wa dzina lace;
Bwerani naco copereka, ndipo fikani pamaso pace;
Lambirani Yehova m'ciyero cokometsetsa,

3:
Tsiku lija likhale mdima;
Mulungu asalifunse kumwamba,
Ndi kuunika kusaliwalire.

Mdima ndi mthunzi wa imfa ziliyese lao lao;
Mtambo ulikhalire;
Zonse zodetsa usana bi ziliopse.

Usiku uja, mdima weni weni uugwere;
Usakondwerere mwa masiku a m'caka;
Usalowe m'ciwerengedwe ca miyezi.

Nyenyezi za cizirezire zide;
Uyembekezere kuunika, koma kuusowe;
Usaone kuphenyuka kwa mbanda kuca;

4:
Unaima ciriri, koma sindinatha kuzindikira maonekedwe ace;
Panali mzukwa pamaso panga;
Kunali cete, ndipo ndidamva mau akuti,

6:
Pakuti mibvi ya Wamphamvuyonse yandilowa,
Mzimu wanga uumwa ulembe wace;
Zoopsa za Mulungu zindindandira nkhondo.

Pamenepo ndidzasangalala,
Ndidzakondwera naco cowawa cosandileka;
Pakuti sindinawabisa mau a Woyerayo.

7:
Ndigona pansi, ndikuti,
Ndidzauka liti? koma usiku undikulira;
Ndipo ndimapalapata mpaka mbanda kuca.

Potero sindidzaletsa pakamwa panga;
Ndidzalankhula popsinjika mumzimu mwanga;
Ndidzadandaula pakuwawa mtima wanga.

Mulekeranji kukhululukira kulakwa kwanga ndi kundicotsera mphulupulu yanga?
Popeza tsopano ndidzagona kupfumbi;
Mudzandifunafuna, koma ine palibe.

9:
Dziko lapansi laperekedwa m'dzanja la woipa;
Aphimba maso a oweruza ace.
Ngati sindiye, pali yaninso?

10:
Ndikakhala woipa, tsoka ine;
Ndikakhala wolungama, sindidzakweza mutuwanga;
Ndadzazidwa ndi manyazi, Koma penyani kuzunzika kwanga.

Mundikonzeranso mboni zonditsutsa,
Ndi kundicurukitsira mkwiyo wanu;
Nkhondo yobwereza-bwereza yandigwera.

12:
Koma inenso ndiri nayo nzeru monga inu.
Sindingakucepereni;
Ndani sadziwa zonga izi?

Ndine ngati munthu wosekedwa ndi mnansi wace,
Ndinaitana kwa Mulungu, ndipo anandiyankha;
Munthu wolungama wangwiro asekedwa.

14:
Momwemo munthu agona pansi, osaukanso;
Kufikira miyamba kulibe, sadzaukanso,
Kapena kuutsidwa pa tulo tace.

Madzi anyenya miyala;
Zosefukira zao zikokolola pfumbi la nthaka;
Ndipo muononga ciyembekezo ca munthu.

15:
Sadzacoka mumdima;
Lawi la moto lidzaumitsa nthambi zace;
Ndipo adzacoka ndi mpumo wa m'kamwa mwace.

16:
Iye ananding'amba m'kundida kwace, nakwiya nane,
Anandikukutira mano;
Mdani wanga ananditong'olera maso ace.

Iwo anandiyasamira pakamwa pao;
Anandiomba pama ndi kunditonza;
Asonkhana pamodzi kunditsutsa.

Ndinali mkupuma, koma anandityola;
Inde anandigwira pakhosi, nandiphwanya;
Anandiimika ndikhale candamali.

Eni mauta ace andizinga,
Ang'amba imso zanga, osazileka;
Natsanulira pansi ndulu yanga.

20:
Auzula, nuturuka m'thupi mwace;
Inde nsonga yonyezimira ituruka m'ndulu mwace;
Zamgwera zoopsa.

Zamdima zonse zimsungikira zikhale cuma cace,
Moto wosaukoleza munthu udzampsereza;
Udzatha wotsalira m'hema mwace.

24:
Taonani, ngati mbidzi za m'cipululu
Aturukira ku nchito zao, nalawirira nkufuna cakudya;
Cipululu ciwaonetsera cakudya ca ana ao.

M'mudzi waukuru anthu abuula alinkufa;
Ndi moyo wa iwo olasidwa upfuula;
Koma Mulungu sasamalira coipaco.

Ndipo diso la wacigololo liyombekezera cisisira,
Ndi kuti, Palibe diso lidzandiona;
Nabvala cophimba pankhope pace.

Atengedwa ngati coyandama pamadzi;
Gawo lao litembereredwa padziko;
Sadzalunjikanso njira ya minda yamphesa.

M'mimba mudzamuiwala; mphutsi zidzamudya mokondwera.
Sadzamkumbukilanso;
Ndipo cosalungama cidzatyoledwa ngati mtengo.

Akwezeka; m'kamphindi kuti zi;
Inde atsitsidwa, acotsedwa monga onse ena,
Adutidwa ngati tirigu ngala zace.

26:
Taonani, awa ndi malekezero a njira zace;
Ndi cimene tikumva za Iye ndi cinong'onezo cacing'ono;
Koma kugunda kwa mphamvu yace akuzindikiritsa ndani?

28:
Aboola mgodi posiyana patali pokhala anthu;
Aiwalika ndi phazi lopitapo;
Apacikika kutali ndi anthu, nalendewa-lendewa.

Koma kwa munthu anati,
Taonani, kuopa Ambuye ndiko nzeru;
Ndi kupatukana naco coipa ndiko luntha.

30:
Aipsa njira yanga,
Athandizana ndi tsoka langa;
Ndiwo anthu omwewo osowa mthandizi.

Anditembenuzira zondiopsa,
Auluza ulemu wanga ngati mphepo;
Ndi zosungika zanga zapita ngati mtambo.

31:
Ngati ndayesa golidi ciyembekezo canga,
Ndi kunena ndi golidi woyengetsa,
Ndiwe cikhazikitso canga;

Popeza ndinaopa unyinji waukuru,
Ndi cipepulo ca mapfuko cinandiopsetsa;
Potero ndinakhala cete osaturuka pakhomo panga.

Ha! ndikadakhala naye wina wakundimvera,
Cizindikilo canga sici, Wamphamvuyonse andiyankhe;
Mwenzi ntakhala nao mau akundineneza analemberawo mdani wangal

32:
Ndipo Elihu mwana wa Barakeli wa ku Buzi anayankha, nati,
Ine ndine mnyamata, inu ndinu okalamba;
Cifukwa cace ndinadziletsa, ndi kuopa kukuonetsani monga umo ndayesera ine.

Inde ndinasamalira inu;
Koma taonani, panalibe womtsutsa Yobu,
Kapena wakumbwezera mau pakati painu.

33:
Akakhala kwa iye mthenga,
Womasulira mau mmodzi mwa cikwi,
Kuonetsera munthu comuyenera;

Apembedza Mulungu, ndipo amkomera mtima;
M'mwemo aona nkhope yace mokondwera;
Ndipo ambwezera munthu cilungamo cace.

34:
Iye akapatsa mpumulo adzamtsutsa ndani?
Akabisa nkhope yace adzampenyerera ndani?
Cikacitika pa mtundu wa anthu, kapena pa munthu, ncimodzimodzi;

Kodi cilango ca Mulungu cikhale monga mucifuna inu, pakuti mucikana?
Musankhe ndi inu, ine ai;
M'mwemo monga mudziwa, nenani.

36:
Inde akadakukopani mucoke posaukira,
Mulowe kucitando kopanda copsinja;
Ndipo zoikidwa pagome panu zikadakhala zonona ndithu.

37:
Ndipo utembenuka-tembenuka pakulangiza kwace,
Kuti ucite ziri zonse aulamulira,
Pa nkhope ya dziko lokhalamo anthu;

1:
Ndiye akunga mtengo wooka pa mitsinje ya madzi;
Wakupatsa cipatso cace pa nyengo yace,
Tsamba lace lomwe losafota;
Ndipo zonse azicita apindula nazo.

3:
Ukani Yehova; ndipulumutseni, Mulungu wanga!
Pakuti mwapanda adani anga onse patsaya;
Mwawatyola mano oipawo.

4:
Pakupfuula ine mundiyankhe, Mulungu wa cilungamo canga;
Pondicepera mwandikulitsira malo:
Ndicitireni cifundo, imvani pemphero langa.

5:
Pakuti m'kamwa mwao mulibe mau okhazikika;
M'kati mwao m'mosakaza;
M'mero mwao ndi manda apululu:
Lilime lao asyasyalika nalo.

Muwayese otsutsika Mulungu;
Agwe nao uphungu wao:
M'kucuruka kwa zolakwa zao muwapitikitse;
Pakuti anapikisana ndi Inu.

Koma akondwere onse amene athawira kwa Inu,
Apfuule mokondwera kosaleka, popeza muwafungatira;
Nasekere mwa Inu iwo akukonda dzina lanu.

6:
Ndalema nako kuusa moyo kwanga;
Ndiyandamitsa kama wanga usiku wonse;
Mphasa yanga ndiolobza ndi misozi yanga.

7:
Mdani alondole moyo wanga, naupeze;
Naupondereze pansi moyo wanga,
Naukhalitse ulemu wanga m'pfumbi.

9:
Adaniwo atha psiti, apululuka nthawi zonse;
Ndipo midziyo mwaipasula,
Cikumbukilo cao pamodzi catha.

Ndicitireni cifundo, Yehova;
Penyani kuzunzika kwanga kumene andicitira ondidawo,
Inu wondinyamula kundicotsa ku zipata za imfa;

Kuti ndibukitse lemekezo lanu lonse;
Pa bwalo la mwana wamkazi wa Ziyoni,
Ndidzakondwera naco cipulumutso canu.

10:
Mayendedwe ace alimbika nthawi zonse;
Maweruzo anu ali pamwamba posaona iye;
Adani ace onse awanyodola.

Akhala m'molalira midzi;
Mobisalamo akupha munthu wosacimwa:
Ambisira waumphawi nkhope yace,

Alalira monga mkango m'ngaka mwace;
Alalira kugwira wozunzika:
Agwira wozunzika, pakumkola m'ukonde mwace.

Mwapenya; pakuti mumayang'anira cibvutitso ndi cisoni kuti acipereke m'manja mwanu;
Waumphawi adzipereka kwa Inu;
Wamasiye mumakhala mthandizi wace.

11:
Yehova ali m'Kacisi wace woyera,
Yehova, mpando wacifumu wace uli m'Mwamba;
Apenyerera ndi maso ace, ayesa ana a anthu ndi zikope zace.

12:
Mau a Yehova ndi mau oona;
Ngati siliva woyenga m'ng'anjo yadothi,
Yoiyeretsa kasanu ndi kawiri.

14:
Waucitsiru amati mumtima mwace, Kulibe Mulungu.
Acita zobvunda, acita nchito zonyansa;
Kulibe wakucita bwino.

15:
M'maso mwace munthu woonongeka anyozeka;
Koma awacitira ulemu akuopa Yehova.
Atalumbira kwa tsoka lace, sasintha ai.

16:
Mudzandidziwitsa njira ya moyo:
Pankhope panu pali cimwemwe cokwanira;
M'dzanja lanu lamanja muli zokondweretsa zomka muyaya.

17:
Mwayesera mtima wanga; mwandizonda usiku;
Mwandisuntha, simupeza kanthu;
Ndatsimikiza mtima kuti m'kamwa mwanga simudzalakwa.

Ukani Yehova,
Mumtsekereze, mumgwetse:
Landitsani moyo wanga kwa woipa ndi lupanga lanu;

18:
Yehova ndiye thanthwe langa, ndi linga langa, ndi mpulumutsi wanga;
Mulungu wanga, ngaka yanga, ndidzakhulupirira Iye;
Cikopa canga, nyanga ya cipulumutso canga, msanje wanga.

Ndipo anagunda m'mwamba Yehova,
Ndipo Wam'mwambamwamba anamvetsa liu lace;
Matalala ndi makala amoto,

Mwandipulumutsa pa zolimbana nane za anthu;
Mwandiika mutu wa amitundu;
Mtundu wa anthu sindinaudziwa udzanditumikira.

19:
Ndiponso muletse kapolo wanu pa zodzitama;
Zisacite ufumu pa ine: pamenepo ndidzakhala wangwiro,
Ndi wosacimwa colakwa cacikuru.

20:
Tsopano ndidziwa kuti Yehova apulumutsa wodzozedwa wace;
Adzambvomereza m'Mwamba mwace moyera
Ndi mphamvu ya cipulumutso ca dzanja lace lamanja.

22:
Mphamvu yanga yauma ngati phale;
Ndi lilime langa likangamira ku nsaya zanga;
Ndipo mwandifikitsa ku pfumbi la imfa.

Pakuti andizinga agaru:
Msonkhano wa oipa wanditsekereza;
Andiboola m'manja anga ndi m'mapazi anga.

Inu akuopa Yehova, mumlemekeze;
Inu nonse mbumba ya Yakobo, mumcitire ulemu;
Ndipo mucite mantha ndi Iye, inu nonse mbumba ya Israyeli.

Pakuti sanapeputsa ndipo sananyansidwa ndi zunzo la wozunzika;
Ndipo sanambisira nkhope yace;
Koma pompfuulira Iye, anamva.

24:
Woyera m'manja, ndi woona m'mtima, ndiye;
Iye amene sanakweza moyo wace kutsata zacabe,
Ndipo salumbira monyenga,

Weramutsani mitu yanu, zipata inu;
Ndipo kwezekani inu, zitseko zosatha:
Kuti Mfumu ya ulemerero ilowe.

Weramutsani mitu yanu, zipata inu;
Inde weramutsani, zitseko zosatha inu,
Kuti Mfumu ya ulemerero ilowe.

25:
Mulungu wanga, ndakhulupirira Inu,
Ndisacite manyazi;
Adani anga asandiseke ine.

Munditsogolere m'coonadi canu, ndipo mundiphunzitse;
Pakuti Inu ndinu Mulungu wa cipulumutso canga;
Inu ndikuyembekezerani tsiku lonseli.

27:
Cifukwa kuti pa dzuwa la tsoka Iye adzandibisa mumsasa mwace:
Adzandibisa m'tsenjezi mwa cihema cace;
Pathanthwe adzandikweza.

Ndipo tsopano mutu wanga udzakwezeka pamwamba pa adani anga akundizinga;
Ndipo ndidzapereka m'cihema mwace nsembe za kupfuula mokondwera;
Ndidzayimba, inde, ndidzayimbira Yehova zomlemekeza.

Musandibisire ine nkhope yanu;
Musacotse kapolo wanu ndi kukwiya:
Inu munakhala thandizo langa;
Musanditaye, ndipo musandisiye Mulungu wa cipulumutso canga,

Yembekeza Yehova:
Limbika, ndipo Iye adzalimbitsa mtima wako;
Inde, yembekeza Yehova.

28:
Muwapatse monga mwa nchito zao, ndi monga mwa coipa cocita iwo:
Muwapatse monga mwa macitidwe a manja ao;
Muwabwezere zoyenera iwo.

Yehova ndiye mphamvu yanga, ndi cikopa canga;
Mtima wanga wakhulupirira Iye, ndipo anandithandiza:
Cifukwa cace mtima wanga ukondwera kwakukuru;
Ndipo ndidzamyamika nayo Nyimbo yanga.

29:
Liu la Yehova liri pamadzi;
Mulungu wa ulemerero agunda,
Ndiye Yehova pa madzi ambiri.

31:
Ndidzakondwera ndi kusangalala m'cifundo canu:
Pakuti mudapenya zunzo langa;
Ndipo mudadziwa mzimu wanga mu nsautso yanga:

32:
Ndinabvomera coipa canga kwa Inu;
Ndipo mphulupulu yanga sindinaibisa.
Ndinati, Ndidzaululira Yehova macimo anga;
Ndipo munakhululukira coipa ca kulakwa kwanga.

35:
Cimgwere modzidzimutsa cionongeko;
Ndipo ukonde wace umene anaucha umkole yekha mwini:
Agwemo, naonongeke m'mwemo.

Koma ine, pakudwala iwowa, cobvala canga ndi ciguduli:
Ndinazunza moyo wanga ndi kusala;
Ndipo pemphero langa linabwera ku cifuwa canga.

36:
Alingirira zopanda pace pakama pace;
Adziika panjira posad pabwino;
Coipa saipidwa naco.

Cilungamo canu cikunga mapiri a Mulungu;
Maweruzo anu akunga cozama cacikuru:
Yehova, musunga munthu ndi nyama.

37:
Oipa anasolola lupanga, nakoka uta wao;
Alikhe ozunzika ndi aumphawi,
Aphe amene ali oongoka m'njira:

38:
Ndipo andichera misampha iwo akufuna moyo wanga;
Ndipo iwo akuyesa kundicitira coipa alankhula zoononga,
Nalingirira zonyenga tsiku lonse.

39:
Mtima wanga unatentha m'kati mwaine;
Unayaka moto pakulingirira ine:
Pamenepo ndinalankhula ndi lilime langa:

Yehova, mundidziwitse cimariziro canga,
Ndi mawerengedwe a masiku anga ndi angati;
Ndidziwe malekezero anga,

Onani, munaika masiku anga akhale monga kuyesa dzanja;
Ndipo zaka zanga ziri ngati cabe pamaso panu:
Indedi munthu ali yense angakhale wokhazikika, ali cabe konse.

40:
Ndipo anapatsa Nyimbo yatsopano m'kamwa mwanga, cilemekezo ca kwa Mulungu wanga;
Ambiri adzaciona, nadzaopa,
Ndipo adzakhulupirira Yehova.

Inu, Yehova, Mulungu wanga, zodabwiza zanu mudazicita nzambiri,
Ndipo zolingirira zanu za pa ife;
Palibe wina wozifotokozera Inu;
Ndikazisimba ndi kuzichula, Zindicurukira kuziwerenga.

Nsembe ndi copereka simukondwera nazo;
Mwanditsegula makutu:
Nsembe yopsereza ndi yamacimo simunapempha.

Ndalalikira cilungamo mu msonkano waukuru;
Onani, sindidzaletsa milomo yanga,
Mudziwa ndinu Yehova.

Cilungamo canu sindinacibisa m'kati mwamtima mwanga;
Cikhulupiriko canu ndi cipulumutso canu ndinacinena;
Cifundo canu ndi coonadi canu sindinacibisira msonkhano waukuru.

Pakuti zoipa zosawerengeka zandizinga,
Zocimwa zanga zandipeza kotero kuti sindikhoza kupenya;
Ziposa tsitsi la mutu wanga, ndipo wandicokera mtima.

41:
Ndipo akadza kundiona wina angonena bodza;
Mumtima mwace adzisonkhera zopanda pace:
Akamka nayenda namakanena:

42:
Adani anga andinyoza ndi kundityola mafupa anga;
Pakunena ndine dzuwa lonse,
Mulungu wako ali kuti?

45:
Inu ndinu wokongola ndithu kuposa ana a anthu;
Anakutsanulirani cisomo pa milomo yanu:
Cifukwa cace Mulungu anakudalitsani kosatha.

Mibvi yanu njakuthwa;
Mitundu ya anthu igwa pansi pa Inu:
Iwalasa mumtima adani a mfumu.

46:
Aletsa nkhondo ku malekezero adziko lapansi;
Athyola uta, nadula nthungo;
Atentha magareta ndi moto.

48:
Penyetsetsani malinga ace,
Yesetsani zinyumba zace;
Kuti mukaziwerengere mibadwo ikudza m'mbuyo.

49:
Mumtima mwao ayesa kuti nyumba zao zikhala cikhalire,
Ndi mokhala iwo ku mibadwo mibadwo;
Achapo dzina lao padziko pao.

Aikidwa m'manda ngati nkhosa;
Mbusa wao ndi imfa:
Ndipo m'mawa mwace oongoka mtima adzakhala mafumu ao;
Ndipo maonekedwe ao adzanyekera kumanda, kuti pokhala pace padzasowa.

50:
Imvani, anthu anga, ndipo ndidzanena;
Israyeli, ndipo ndidzacita mboni pa iwe:
Ine Mulungu, ndine Mulungu wako.

Izi unazicita iwe, ndipo ndinakhala cete Ine;
Unayesa kuti ndifanana nawe:
Ndidzakudzudzula, ndi kucilongosola pamaso pako.

Wopereka nsembe yaciyamiko andilemekeza Ine;
Ndipo kwa iye wosunga mayendedwe ace
Ndidzamuonetsa cipulumutso ca Mulungu.

51:
Mundilanditse ku mlandu wa mwazi, Mulungu,
Ndinu Mulungu wa cipulumutso canga;
Lilime langalidzakweza Nyimbo ya cilungamo canu.

52:
Tapenyani, suyu munthuyu amene sanamuyesa Mulungu mphamvu yace;
Amene anatama kucuruka kwa cuma cace,
Nadzilimbitsa m'kuipsa kwace.

53:
Citsiru cimati mumtima mwace, Kulibe Mulungu.
Acita zobvunda, acita cosalungama conyansa;
Kulibe wakucita bwino.

Kodi ocita zopanda pace sadziwa?
Pomadya anthu anga monga akudya mkate;
Ndipo saitana Mulungu.

Pamenepo anaopa kwakukuru, popanda cifukwa ca kuopa:
Pakuti Mulungu anamwaza mafupa a iwo akuzinga iwe;
Unawacititsa manyazi, pakuti Mulungu anawakaniza.

54:
Pakuti alendo andiukira,
Ndipo oopsa afunafuna moyo wanga;
Sadziikira Mulungu pamaso pao.

55:
Pakuti si mdani amene ananditonzayo;
Pakadatero ndikadacilola:
Amene anadzikuza pa ine sindiye munthu wondida;
Pakadatero ndikadambisalira:

Koma Inu, Mulungu, mudzawatsitsira ku dzenje la cionongeko:
Anthu okhetsa mwazi ndi acinyengo masiku ao sadzafikira nusu;
Koma ine ndidzakhulupirira Inu.

56:
Mwa Mulungu ndidzalemekeza mau ace:
Ndakhulupirira Mulungu, sindidzaopa;
Anthu adzandicitanji?

Muwerenga kuthawathawa kwanga:
Sungani misozi yanga m'nsupa yanu;
Kodi siikhala m'buku mwanu?

57:
Adzanditumizira m'mwamba, nadzandipulumutsa
Ponditonza wofuna kundimeza;
Mulungu adzatumiza cifundo cace ndi coonadi cace.

Anandichera ukonde apo ndiyenda;
Moyo wanga wawerama:
Anandikumbira mbuna patsogolo panga;
Anagwa m'kati mwace iwo okha.

59:
Pakuti onani, alalira moyo wanga;
Amphamvu andipangira ciwembu:
Osacimwa, osalakwa ine, Yehova,

Onani abwetuka pakamwa pao;
M'milomo mwao muli lupanga,
Pakuti amati, Amva ndani?

60:
Gileadi ndi wanga, Manasenso ndi wanga;
Ndipo Efraimu ndi mphamvu ya mutu wanga;
Yuda ndiye wolamulira wanga,

Moabu ndiye mkhate wanga;
Pa Edomu ndidzaponya nsapato yanga:
Filistiya, pfuulatu cifukwa ca ine.

62:
Komatu amkhaliraupo kuti amkankhire pansi ulemu wace;
Akondwera nao mabodza;
Adalitsa ndi m'kamwa mwao, Koma atemberera mumtima.

Indetu, anthu acabe ndi mpweya, ndipo anthu akuru ndi bodza:
Pakuwayesa apepuka;
Onse pamodzi apepuka koposa mpweya,

63:
Koma mfumu idzakondwera mwa Mulungu;
Yense wakulumbirira iye adzatamandira;
Pakuti pakamwa pa iwo onena bodza padzatsekedwa.

64:
Alimbikitsana m'cinthu coipa;
Apangana za kuchera misampha mobisika;
Akuti, Adzaiona ndani?

Ndipo anthu onse adzacita mantha;
Nadzabukitsa cocita Mulungu,
Nadzasamalira nchito yace.

65:
Mukhutitsa nthaka yace yolima;
Mufafaniza nthumbira zace?
Muiolowetsa ndi mbvumbi;
Mudalitsa mmera wace.

Podyetsa mpodzaza ndi zoweta;
Ndipo zigwa zakutidwa ndi tirigu;
Zipfuula mokondwera, inde ziyimbira.

66:
Dziko lonse lapansi lidzakugwadirani,
Ndipo lidzakuyimbirani;
Adzayimbira dzina lanu.

Acita ufumu mwa mphamvu yace kosatha;
Maso ace ayang'anira amitundu;
Opikisana ndi Iye asadzikuze.

Ndidzakufukizirani nsembe zapsereza zonona,
Pamodzi ndi cofukiza ca mphongo za nkhosa;
Ndidzakonza ng'ombe pamodzi ndi mbuzi.

67:
Anthu akondwere, napfuule makondwera;
Pakuti mudzaweruza anthu malunjika,
Ndipo mudzalangiza anthu pa dziko lapansi.

68:
Yimbirani Yehova, liyimbireni Nyimbo dzina lace;
Undirani mseu Iye woberekekayo kucidikha;
Dzina lace ndiye Yehova; ndipo tumphani ndi cimwemwe pamaso pace.

Mulungu amangitsira banjaanthu a pa okha;
Aturutsa am'ndende alemerere;
Koma opikisana naye akhala m'dziko lopanda madzi.

Dziko lapansi linagwedezeka,
Inde thambo linakhapamaso pa Mulungu;
Sinai lomwe linagwedezeka pamaso pa Mulungu, Mulungu wa Israyeli.

Munakwera kumka kumwamba, munapita nao undende kuuyesa ndende;
Munalandira zaufulu mwa anthu,
Ngakhale mwa opikisana nanu, kuti Yehova Mulungu akakhale nao.

Bvomerezani kuti mphamvu nja Mulungu;
Ukulu wace uli pa Israyeli,
Ndi mphamvu yace m'mitambo.

Inu Mulungu, ndinu woopsa m'malo oyera anu;
Mulungu wa Israyeli ndiye amene apatsa anthu ace mphamvu ndi cilimbiko.
Alemekezeke Mulungu.

69:
Ondida kopanda cifukwa acuruka koposa tsitsi la pamutu panga;
Ofuna kunditha, ndiwo adani anga monama, ali ndi mphamvu:
Pamenepo andibwezetsa cosafunkha ine.

Koma ine, pemphero langa liri kwa Inu, Yehova, m'nyengo yolandirika;
Mulungu, mwa cifundo canu cacikuru,
Mundibvomereze ndi coonadi ca cipulumutso canu.

Cigumula cisandifotsere,
Ndipo cakuya cisandimize;
Ndipo asanditsekere pakamwa pace pa dzenje.

Cotonza candiswera mtima, ndipo ndidwala ine;
Ndipo ndinayembekeza wina wondicitira cifundo, koma palibe;
Ndinayembekeza onditonthoza mtima, osawapeza.

70:
Asekerere nakondwerere mwa Inu onse akufuna Inu;
Nanene kosalekeza iwo akukonda cipulumutso canu,
Abuke Mulungu.

Koma ine ndine wozunzika ndi waumphawi;
Mundifulumirire, Mulungu:
Inu ndinu mthandizi wanga ndi mpulumutsi wanga;
Musacedwe, Yehova.

71:
Mundikhalire thanthwe lokhalamo, lopitako kosaleka;
Mwalamulira kundipulumutsa;
Popeza Inu ndinu thanthwe langa ndi linga langa,

Inu munandigwirizizakuyambira ndisanabadwe:
Kuyambira pa thupi la mai wanga wondicitira zokoma ndinu;
Ndidzakulemekezani kosalekeza.

Pakamwa panga padzafotokozera cilungamo canu,
Ndi cipulumutso canu tsiku lonse;
Pakuti sindidziwa mawerengedwe ace.

Poteronso pokalamba ine ndi kukhala nazo imvi musandisiye, Mulungu;
Kufikira nditalalikira mbadwo uwu za dzanja lanu,
Mphamvu yanu kwa onse akudza m'mbuyo.

Cilungamo canunso, Mulungu, cifikira kuthambo;
Inu amene munacita zazikuru,
Akunga Inu ndani, Mulungu?

72:
Ndipo iye adzakhala ndi moyo; ndipo adzampatsa golidi wa ku Sheba;
Nadzampempherera kosalekeza;
Adzamlemekeza tsiku lonse.

M'dzikomo mudzakhala dzinthu dzocuruka pamwamba pa mapiri;
Zipatso zace zidzati waa, ngati za ku Lebano:
Ndipo iwo a m'mudzi adzaphuka ngati msipu wapansi.

Ndipo dzina lace la ulemerero lidalitsike kosatha;
Ndipo dziko lonse lapansi lidzale nao ulemerero wace.
Amen, ndi Amen.

74:
Kumbukilani msonkhano wanu, umene munaugula kale,
Umene munauombola ukhale pfuko la colandira canu;
Phiri La Ziyoni limene mukhalamo.

Sitiziona zizindikilo zathu;
Palibenso mneneri;
Ndipo mwa ife palibe wina wakudziwa mpaka liti.

75:
Pakuti m'dzanja la Yehova muli cikho;
Ndi vinyo wace acita thobvu;
Cidzala ndi zosanganizira, ndipo atsanulako:
Indedi, oipa onse a pa dziko lapansi adzamwa
Nadzagugudiza nsenga zace.

77:
Tsiku la nsautso yanga ndinafuna Ambuye:
Dzanja langa linatambalika usiku, losaleka;
Mtima wanga unakanakutonthozedwa.

Ndikumbukila Nyimbo yanga, usiku;
Ndilingalira mumtima mwanga;
Mzimu wanga unasanthula.

Madziwo anakuonani Mulungu;
Anakuonani madziwo; anacita mantha:
Zozama zomwe zinanjenjemera,

Makongwa anatsanula madzi;
Thambo lidamvetsa liu lace;
Mibvi yanu yomwe inaturukira.

Liu la bingu lanu linatengezanatengezana;
Mphezi zinaunikira ponse pali anthu;
Dziko lapansi linanjenjemera ndi kugwedezeka.

78:
Cifukwa cace Yehova anamva, nakwiya;
Ndipo anayatsa moto pa Yakobo,
Ndiponso mkwiyo unakwera pa Israyeli;

Analambulira mkwiyo wace njira;
Sanalekerera moyo wao usafe,
Koma anapereka moyo wao kumliri;

Ndipo anawatsogolera mokhulupirika,
Kotero kuti sanaopa;
Koma nyanja inamiza adani ao.

79:
Mulungu, akunja alowa m'colandira canu;
Anaipsa Kacisi wanu woyera;
Anacititsa Yerusalemu bwinja.

Musakumbukile moritsutsa mphulupulu za makolo athu;
Nsoni zokoma zanu zitikumike msanga:
Pakuti tafoka kwambiri.

Potero ife anthu anu ndi nkhosa za pabusa panu
Tidzakuyamikani kosatha;
Tidzafotokozera cilemekezo canu ku mibadwo mibadwo.

80:
Mbusa wa Israyeli, cherani khutu;
Inu wakutsogolera Yosefe ngati nkhosa;
Inu wokhala pa akerubi, walitsani.

81:
Unaitana posautsika, ndipo ndinakulanditsa;
Ndinakubvomereza mobisalika m'bingu;
Ndinakuyesa ku madzi a Meriba.

82:
Sadziwa, ndipo sazindikira;
Amayendayenda mumdima;
Maziko onse a dziko lapansi agwedezeka.

84:
Pakuti Yehova Mulungu ndiye dzuwa ndi cikopa;
Yehova adzapatsa cifundo ndi ulemerero;
Sadzakaniza cokoma iwo akuyenda angwiro,

85:
Ndidzamva colankhula Mulungu Yehova;
Pakuti adzalankhula zamtendere ndi anthu ace, ndi okondedwa ace;
Koma asabwererenso kucita zapusa.

86:
Mundibwerere ine, ndi kundicitira cifundo;
Mpatseni mtumiki wanu mphamvu yanu,
Ndipo pulumutsani mwana wa mdzakazi wanu.

Mundicitire cizindikilo coti cabwino;
Kuti ondida acione, nacite manyazi,
Popeza Inu, Yehova, munandithandiza ndi kundisangalatsa,

87:
Ndidzachula Rahabu ndi Babulo kwa iwo ondidziwa Ine;
Taonani, Filistiya ndi Turo pamodzi ndi Kusi;
Uyu anabadwa komweko.

Ndipo adzanena za Ziyoni,
Uyu ndi uyo anabadwa m'mwemo;
Ndipo Wam'mwambamwamba ndiye aclzaukhazikitsa.

88:
Munandisiyanitsira wodziwana nane kutali;
Munandiika ndiwakhalire conyansa:
Ananditsekereza osakhoza kuturuka ine.

Diso langa lapuwala cifukwa ca kuzunzika kwanga:
Ndimaitana Inu, Yehova, tsiku lonse;
Nditambalitsira manja anga kwa Inu.

89:
Pamenepo munalankhula m'masompenya ndi okondedwa anu,
Ndipo mudati, Ndasenza thandizo pa ciphona;
Ndakweza wina wosankhika mwa anthu.

90:
Masiku a zaka zathu ndiwo zaka makumi asanu ndi awiri,
Kapena tikakhala nayo mphamvudi zaka makumi asanu ndi atatu;
Koma teronso kukula kwao kumati cibvuto ndi copanda pace;
Pakuti kumapitako msanga ndipo tithawa ife tomwe.

Ndipo cisomo cace ca Yehova Mulungu wathu cikhale pa ife;
Ndipo mutikhazikitsire ife nchito ya manja athu;
Inde, nchito ya manja athu muikhazikitse.

91:
Adzakufungatira ndi nthenga zace,
Ndipo udzathawira kunsi kwa mapiko ace;
Coonadi cace ndico cikopa cocinjiriza.

Pambali pako padzagwa cikwi,
Ndi zikwi khumi pa dzanja lamanja lako;
Sicidzakuyandikiza iwe.

Adzandipfuulira Ine ndipo ndidzamyankha;
Kunsautso ndidzakhala naye pamodzi;
Ndidzamlanditsa, ndi kumcitira ulemu.

92:
Cakuti pophuka oipa ngati msipu,
Ndi popindula ocita zopanda pace;
Citero kuti adzaonongeke kosatha:

Pakuti, taonani, adani anu, Yehova,
Pakuti, taonani, adani anu adzatayika;
Ocita zopanda pace onse adzamwazika.

93:
Yehova acita ufumu; wadzibveka ndi ukulu;
Wadzibveka Yehova, wadzimangirira mphamvu m'cuuno;
Dziko lomwe lokhalamo anthu likhazikika, silidzagwedezeka.

Mitsinje ikweza, Yehova,
Mitsinje ikweza mkokomo wao;
Mitsinje ikweza mafunde ao.

94:
Ndipo anawabwezera zopanda pace zao,
Nadzawaononga m'coipa cao;
Yehova Mulungu wathu adzawaononga.

96:
Nenani mwa amitundu, Yehova acita ufumu;
Dziko lokhalamo anthu lomwe likhazikika kuti silingagwedezeke;
Adzaweruza mitundu ya anthu molunjika.

97:
Ziyoni anamva nakondwera,
Nasekerera ana akazi a Yuda;
Cifukwa ca maweruzo anu, Yehova.

Inuokonda Yehova, danani naco coipa:
Iye asunga moyo wa okondedwa ace;
Awalanditsa m'manja mwa oipa.

98:
Myimbireni Yehova nyimbo yatsopano;
Popeza anacita zodabwiza:
Dzanja lace lamanja, mkono wace woyera, zinamcitira cipulumutso,

Pamaso pa Yehova, popeza akudza kudzaweruza dziko lapansi;
Adzaweruza dziko lokhalamo anthu ndi cilungamo,
Ndi mitundu ya anthu molunjika,

99:
Ndipo mphamvu ya mfumu ikonda ciweruzo;
Inu mukhazikitsa zolunjika,
Mucita ciweruzo ndi cilungamo m'Yakobo.

Mwa ansembe ace muli Mose ndi Aroni,
Ndi Samueli mwa iwo akuitanira dzina lace;
Anaitana kwa Yehova, ndipo Iye anawayankha.

Mkwezeni Yehova Mulungu wathu,
Ndipo gwadirani pa phiri lace loyera;
Pakuti Yehova Mulungu wathu ndiye woyera.

100:
Dziwani kuti Yehova ndiye Mulungu;
Iyeyu anatilenga, ndipo ife ndife ace;
Ndife anthu ace ndi nkhosa za pabusa pace.

101:
Ndidzacita mwanzeru m'njira yangwiro;
Mudzandidzera liti?
Ndidzayenda m'nyumba mwanu ndi mtima wangwiro.

Sindidzaika cinthu coipa pamaso panga;
Cocita iwo akupatuka padera cindiipira;
Sicidzandimamatira.

102:
Musandibisire nkhope yanu tsiku la nsautso yanga;
Mundichereze khutu lanu;
Tsiku limene ndiitana ine mundiyankhe msanga,

Zidzatha izi, koma Inu mukhala:
Inde, zidzatha zonse ngati cabvala;
Mudzazisintha ngati maraya, ndipo zidzasinthika:

103:
Lemekezani Yehova, inu angelo ace;
A mphamvu zolimba, akucita mau ace,
Akumvera liu la mau ace.

104:
Mubvala ulemu ndi cifumu.
Amene mudzikuta nako kuunika monga ndi cobvala;
Ndi kuyala thambo ngati nsaru yocinga;

Amene alumikiza mitanda ya zipinda zace m'madzi;
Naika makongwa akhale agareta ace;
Nayenda pa mapiko a mphepo;

Ameretsa msipu ziudye ng'ombe,
Ndi zitsamba acite nazo munthu;
Naturutse cakudya cocokera m'nthaka;

Nchito zanu zicurukadi, Yehova!
Munazicita zonse mwanzeru;
Dziko lapansi lidzala naco cuma canu.

Nyanja siyo, yaikuru ndi yacitando,
M'mwemo muli zokwawa zosawerengeka;
Zamoyo zazing'ono ndi zazikuru.

Mukabisa nkhope yanu, ziopsedwa;
Mukalanda mpweya wao, zikufa,
Nizibwerera kupfumbi kwao.

106:
Makolo athu sanadziwitsa zodabwiza zanu m'Aigupto;
Sanakumbukila zacifundo zanu zaunyinji;
Koma anapikisana ndi Inu kunyanja, ku Nyanja Yofiira.

Nakhetsa mwazi wosacimwa, ndi wo mwazi wa ana ao amuna ndi akazi,
Amene anawaperekera nsembe mafano a Kanani;
M'mwemo analidetsa dziko ndi mwaziwo.

Iye anawalanditsa kawiri kawiri;
Koma anapikisana ndi Iye mwa uphungu wao,
Ndi mphulupulu zao zinawafoketsa,

108:
Gileadi ndi wanga: Manase ndi wanga;
Ndi Efraimu ndiye mphamvu ya mutu wanga;
Yuda ndiye wolamulira wanga.

Moabu ndiye mkhate wanga;
Pa Edomu ndidzaponya nsapato yanga;
Ndidzapfuulira Filistiya,

110:
Adzaweruza mwa amitundu,
Adzadzaza dziko ndi mitembo;
Adzaphwanya mitu m'maiko ambiri.

111:
Anatumizira anthu ace cipulumutso;
Analamulira cipangano cace kosatha;
Dzina lace ndilo loyera ndi loopedwa.

Kumuopa Yehova ndiko ciyambi ca nzeru;
Onse akucita cotero ali naco cidziwitso cokoma;
Cilemekezo cace cikhalitsa kosatha.

112:
Anagawagawa, anapatsa aumphawi;
Cilungamo cace cikhalitsa kosatha;
Nyanga yace idzakwezeka ndi ulemu.

Woipa adzaziona, nadzapsa mtima;
Adzakukuta mano, nadzasungunuka;
Cokhumba oipa cidzatayika.

113:
Haleluya;
Lemekezani, inu atumiki a Yehova;
Lemekezani dzina la Yehova,

115:
Manja ali nao, koma osagwira;
Mapazi ali nao, koma osayenda;
Kapena sanena pammero pao,

Yehova watikumbukila; adzatidalitsa:
Adzadalitsa nyumba ya Israyeli;
Adzadalitsa nyumba ya Aroni.

116:
Ndiloleni, Yehova, indetu ndine mtumiki wanu;
Ndine mtumiki wanu, mwana wa mdzakazi wanu;
Mwandimasulira zondimanga,

117:
Pakuti cifundo cace ca pa ife ndi cacikuru;
Ndi coonadi ca Yehova ncosatha.
Haleluya.

118:
Adandizinga ngati njuci;
Anazima ngati moto waminga;
Indedi, m'dzina la Yehova ndidzawaduladula.

122:
Kumene akwerako mafuko, ndiwo mafuko a Yehova;
Akhale mboni ya kwa Israyeli,
Ayamike dzina la Yehova.

127:
Kuli cabe kwa inu Rulawirira mamawa ndi kusagonerapo madzulo,
Kudya mkate wosautsa kuupeza;
Kuli tero kuti izi apatsa okondedwa ace ngati m'tulo.

129:
Angakhale opitirirapo sanena,
Dalitso la Mulungu likhale pa inu;
Tikudalitsani m'dzina la Yehova.

130:
Ambuye, imvani liu langa;
Makutu anu akhale cimverere
Mau a kupemba kwanga.

Moyo wanga uyang'anira Ambuye,
Koposa alonda matanda kuca;
Inde koposa alonda matanda kuca.

Israyeli, uyembekezere Yehova;
Cifukwa kwa Yehova kuli cifundo,
Kwaonso kucurukira ciombolo.

131:
Indedi, ndinalinganiza ndi kutontholetsa moyo wanga;
Ngati mwana womletsa kuyamwa amace,
Moyo wanga ndiri nao ngati mwana womletsa kuyamwa.

132:
Yehova analumbira Davide zoona;
Sadzalibweza; ndi kuti,
Wa iwo okhala zipatso za thupi lako ndidzaika pa mpando wacifumu wako.

135:
Haleluya;
Lemekezani dzina la Yehova;
Lemekezani inu atumiki a Yehova:

Akweza mitambo icokere ku malekezero a dziko lapansi;
Ang'animitsa mphezi zidzetse mvula;
Aturutsa mphepo mosungira mwace.

137:
Mwana wamkazi wa ku Babulo, iwe amene udzapasulidwa;
Wodala iye amene adzakubwezera cilango
Monga umo unaticitira ife.

138:
Ndingakhale ndiyenda pakati pa nsautso, mudzandipatsa moyo;
Mudzatambasula dzanja lanu pa mkwiyo wa adani anu,
Ndipo dzanja lanu lamanja lidzandipulumutsa.

139:
Ndikuyamikani cifukwa kuti cipangidwe canga ncoopsa ndi codabwiza;
Nchito zanu nzodabwiza;
Moyo wanga ucidziwa ici bwino ndithu.

140:
Ndilindireni Yehova, ndisalowe m'manja mwa woipa;
Ndisungeni kwa munthu waciwawa;
Kwa iwo akuti akankhe mapazi anga.

Odzikuzaanandichera msampha, nandibisira zingwe;
Anacha ukonde m'mphepete mwa njira;
Anandichera makwekwe.

Makala amoto awagwere;
Aponyedwe kumoto;
M'maenje ozama, kuti asaukenso.

142:
Ndinapfuulira kwa inu, Yehova;
Ndina, Inu ndinu pothawirapo panga,
Gawo langa m'dziko la amoyo.

Turutsani moyo wanga m'ndende, kuti ndiyamike dzina lanu;
Olungama adzandizinga;
Pakuti mudzandicitira zokoma.

143:
Pakuti mdani alondola moyo wanga;
Apondereza pansr moyo wanga;
Andikhalitsa mumdima monga iwo adafa kale lomwe.

Ndikumbukila masiku a kale lomwe;
Zija mudazicita ndilingirirapo;
Ndikamba pa ndekha za nchito ya manja anu.

Fulumirani ndiyankheni, Yehova; mzimu wanga ukutha.
Musandibisire nkhope yanu;
Ndingafanane nao akutsikira kudzenje.

Mundimvetse cifundo canu mamawa;
Popeza ndikhulupirira Inu:
Mundidziwitse njira ndiyendemo;
Popeza ndikweza moyo wanga kwa Inu.

Ndipo mwa cifundo canu mundidulire adani anga,
Ndipo muononge onse akusautsa moyo wanga;
Pakuti ine ndine mtumiki wanu.

144:
Ndiye cifundo canga, ndi linga langa,
Msanje wanga, ndi mpulumutsi wanga;
Cikopa canga, ndi Iye amene ndimtama;
Amene andigonjetsera anthu anga.

Turutsani manja anu kucokera m'mwamba;
Ndikwatuleni ndi kundilanditsa ku madzi akuru,
Ku dzanja la alendo;

Kuti ng'ombe zathu zikhale zasenza katundu;
Ndi kuti pasakhale kupasula linga kapena kuturukamo,
Pasakhalenso kupfuula m'makwalala athu.

146:
Amene analenga zakumwamba ndi dziko lapansi,
Nyanja ndi zonse ziri m'mwemo;
Ndiye wakusunga coonadi kosatha:

Ndiye wakucitira ciweruzo osautsika;
Ndiye wakupatsa anjala cakudya;
Yehova amasula akaidi;

Yehova apenyetsa osaona;
Yehova aongoletsa onse owerama;
Yehova akonda olungama;

Yehova asunga alendo;
Agwiriziza mwana wamasiye mkazi wamasiye;
Koma akhotetsa njira ya oipa.

147:
Haleluya;
Pakuti kuyimbira zomlemekeza Mulungu wathu nkokoma;
Pakuti cikondwetsa ici, cilemekezo ciyenera.

Sanatero nao anthu amtundu wina;
Ndipo za maweruzo ace, sanawadziwa.
Haleluya.

148:
Haleluya.
Lemekezani Yehova kocokera kumwamba;
Mlemekezeni m'misanje.

Alemekeze dzina la Yehova;
Pakuti dzina lace lokha ndi lokwezeka;
Ulemerero wace uli pamwamba pa dziko lapansi ndi thambo.

150:
Haleluya,
Lemekezani Mulungu m'malo ace oyera;
Mlemekezeni m'thambo la mphamvu yace.

1:
Tembenukani pamene ndikudzudzulani;
Taonani, nditsanulira pa inu mzimu wanga,
Ndikudziwitsani mau anga.

Pakudza mantha anu ngati mphepo yopasula,
Ndi pofika tsoka lanu ngati kabvumvulu;
Pakudza kwa inu bvuto ndi nsautso.

3:
Cifundo ndi coonadi zisakusiye;
Uzimange pakhosi pako;
Uzilembe pamtima pako;

Usanene kwa mnzako, Ukabwerenso,
Ndipo mawa ndidzakupatsa;
Pokhala uli nako kanthu.

4:
Atate nandiphunzitsa, nati kwa ine,
Mtima wako uumirire mau anga;
Sunga malamulo anga, nukhale ndi moyo.

5:
Ngati mbawala yokonda ndi cinkhoma cacisomo,
Maere ace akukwanire nthawi zonse;
Ukodwe ndi cikondi cace osaleka.

6:
Cita ici tsono; mwananga, nudzipulumutse;
Popeza walowa m'dzanja la mnzako,
Pita nudzicepetse, numdandaulire mnzako,

7:
Pakuti pa zenera la nyumba yanga
Ndinapenyera pa made ace;
Ndinaona pakati pa acibwana,

Mpaka mubvi ukapyoza mphafa yace;
Amtsata monga mbalame yotamangira msampha;
Osadziwa kuti adzaononga moyo wace.

8:
Poikira nyanja malire ace,
Kuti madzi asapitirire pa lamulo lace;
Polemba maziko a dziko,

Ndinali pa mbali pace ngati mmisiri;
Ndinamsekeretsa tsiku ndi tsiku,
Ndi kukondwera pamaso pace nthawi zonse;

18:
Kupembedza mbale utamcimwira nkobvuta,
Kulanda mudzi wolimba nkosabvuta;
Makangano akunga mipiringidzo ya linga.

19:
Abale onse a wosauka amuda;
Nanga mabwenzi ace kodi satanimphirana naye?
Awatsata ndi mau, koma kuli zi.

Kuopa Yehova kupatsa moyo;
Wokhala nako adzakhala wokhuta;
Zoipa sizidzamgwera.

23:
Pakuti monga asinkha m'kati mwace, ali wotere;
Ati kwa iwe, Idya numwe;
Koma mtima wace suli pa iwe.

Udzati, Anandimenya, osaphwetekedwa ine;
Anandikwapula, osamva ine;
Ndidzauka nthawi yanji? Ndidzafuna-funanso vinyoyo.

24:
Potero udzadziwa kuti nzeru iri yotero m'moyo wako;
Ngati waipeza padzakhala mphotho,
Ndipo ciyembekezo cako sicidzalephereka.

Taonani, ponsepo panamera minga,
Ndi kuwirirapo khwisa;
Chinga lace lamiyala ndi kupasuka.

25:
Monga cisanu ca cipale cofewa pa nthawi ya masika,
Momwemo mthenga wokhulupirika kwa amene anamtuma;
Atsitsimutsa moyo wa ambuyace.

27:
Mnzako, ndi mnzace wa atate wako, usawasiye;
Usanke ku nyumba ya mbale wako tsiku la tsoka lako;
Mnansi wapafupi aposa mbale wakutari.

28:
Wosoceretsa oongoka mtima alowe m'njira yoipa,
Adzagwa mwini m'dzenje lace;
Koma angwiro adzalandira colowa cabwino.

30:
Mundicotsere kutari zacabe ndi mabodza;
Musandipatse umphawi, ngakhale cuma,
Mundidyetse zakudya zondiyenera;

Pakuti potakasa mkaka, mafuta ayengekapo;
Ndi popsinja mpfuno, mwazi uturukamo;
Ndi potimbikira mkwiyo ndeu ionekamo.

1:
Mafuta ako anunkhira bwino;
Dzina lako likunga mafuta onunkhira otsanulidwa;
Cifukwa cace anamwali akukonda.

2:
Maluwa aoneka pansi;
Nthawi yoyimba mbalame yafika,
Mau a njiwa namveka m'dziko lathu;

Nkhunda yangawe, yokhala m'ming'alu ya thanthwe, mobisika motsetsereka,
Ndipenye nkhope yako, ndimve manako;
Pakuti mau ako ngokoma, nkhope yako ndi kukongola.

3:
Taonani, ndi macila a Solomo;
Pazingapo amuna amphamvu makumi asanu ndi limodzi,
A mwa ngwazi za Israyeli.

4:
Walanda mtima wanga, mlongwanga, mkwatibwi;
Walanda mtima wanga ndi diso lako limodzi,
Ndi cinganga cimodzi ca pakhosi pako,

M'milomo yako, mkwatibwi, mukukha uci,
Uci ndi mkaka ziri pansi pa lilime lako;
Kununkhira kwa zobvala zako ndi kunga kununkhira kwa Lebano,

Mphoka ndi cikasu,
Nzimbe ndi ngaho, ndi mitengo yonse yamtanthanyerere;
Nipa ndi khonje, ndi zonunkhiritsa zonse zomveka.

5:
Ndalowa m'munda mwanga, mlongwanga, mkwatibwi:
Ndachera nipa yanga ndi zonunkhiritsa zanga;
Ndadya uci wanga ndi cisa cace;
Ndamwa vinyo wanga ndi mkaka wanga.
Idyani, atsamwalinu,
Imwani, mwetsani cikondi.

Ndinauka ndikatsegulire bwenzi langa;
Pamanja panga panakha nipa.
Ndi pa zala zanga madzi a nipa, Pa zogwirira za mpikizo,

Ndinamtsegulira bwenzi langalo;
Koma ndinampeza, bwenzi langa atacoka.
Moyo wanga unalefuka polankhula iye:
Ndinamfunafuna, osampeza;
Ndinamuitana, koma sanandibvomera.

Alonda akuyenda m'mudzi anandipeza,
Nandikantha, nanditema;
Osunga maguta nandicotsera cophimba canga.

6:
Nkhunda yanga, wangwiro wangayu, ndiye mmodzi;
Ndiye wobadwa yekha wa amace;
Ndiye wosankhika wa wombala.
Ana akazi anamuona, namucha wodala;
Ngakhale akazi akulu a mfumu, ndi akazi ang'ono namtamanda.

7:
Khosi lako likunga nsanja yaminyanga;
Maso ako akunga matawale a ku Hesiboni,
A pa cipata ca Batirabimu;
Mphuno yako ikunga nsanja ya ku Lebano
Imene iloza ku Damasiko.

Mutu wako ukunga Karimeli,
Ndi tsitsi la pamtu pako likunga nsaru yakuda;
Mfumu yamangidwa ndi nkhata zace ngati wamsinga.

Tilawire kunka ku minda yamipesa;
Tiyang'ane ngati mpesa waphuka, kunje ndi kuonetsa zipatso,
Makangaza ndi kutuwa maluwa ace;
Pompo ndidzakupatsa cikondi canga,

8:
Undilembe pamtima pako, mokhoma cizindikilo, nundikhomenso cizindikilo pamkono pako;
Pakuti cikondi cilimba ngati imfa;
Njiru imangouma ngati manda:
Kung'anima kwace ndi kung'anima kwa moto,
Ngati mphezi ya Yehova,

Solomo anali ndi munda wamipesa ku Baalahamoni;
Nabwereka alimi mundawo;
Yense ambwezere ndalama cikwi cifukwa ca zipatso zace.

Koma munda wanga wamipesa, uli pamaso panga ndiwo wangatu;
Naco cikwico, Solomo iwe,
Koma olima zipatso zace azilandira mazana awiri.

38:
Pokhala panga pacotsedwa, pandisunthikira monga hema wambusa;
Ndapindapinda moyo wanga ngati muomba;
Iye adzandidula ine poomberapo;
Kuyambira usana kufikira usiku mudzanditsiriza ine.

Ndinalankhula-lankhula ngati namzeze, pena cumba;
Ndinalira maliro ngati nkhunda;
Maso anga analephera pogadamira kumwamba.
Yehova ndasautsidwa, mundiperekere cikoli.

Pakuti kunsi kwa manda sikungakuyamikeni Inu;
Imfa singakulemekezeni;
Otsikira kudzenje sangaziyembekeze zoona zanu.

Yehova ndiye wondipulumutsa ine;
Cifukwa cace tidzayimba nyimbo zanga, ndi zoyimba zazingwe
Masiku onse a moyo wathu m'nyumba ya Yehova.

1:
Yuda watengedwa ndende cifukwa ca msauko ndi ukapolo waukuru;
Akhala mwa amitundu, sapeza popuma;
Onse akumlondola anampeza pakati popsinjikiza.

M'njira za Ziyoni mulira posoweka akudzera msonkhano;
Pa zipata zace zonse papasuka; ansembe ace onse ausa moyo;
Anamwali ace asautsidwa; iye mwini namva zowawa.

Amaliwongo ace asanduka akuru ace, adani ace napindula;
Pakuti Yehova wamsautsa pocuruka zolakwa zace;
Ana ace ang'ono alowa m'ndende pamaso pa adani ace.

Ulemu wace wonse wamcokera mwana wamkazi wa Ziyoni;
Akalonga ace asanduka nswala zosapeza busa,
Anayenda opanda mphamvu pamaso pa wompitikitsa.

Yerusalemu wacimwa kwambiri; cifukwa cace wasanduka cinthu conyansa;
Onse akuulemekeza aupeputsa, pakuti auona wamarisece;
Inde, uusa moyo, nubwerera m'mbuyo.

Udio wace unali m'nsaru zace; sunakumbukira citsiriziro cace;
Cifukwa cace watsika mozizwitsa; ulibe wakuutonthoza;
Taonani Yehova, msauko wanga, pakuti mdaniyo wadzikuzayekha.

Amaliwongo atambasulira manja ao pa zokondweretsa zace zonse;
Pakuti waona amitundu atalowa m'malo ace opatulika,
Amene munalamulira kuti asalowe mumsonkhano mwanu.

Anthu ace onse ausa moyo nafunafuna mkate;
Ndi zokondweretsa zao agula zakudya kuti atsitsimutse moyo wao;
Taonani, Yehova, nimupenye; pakuti ndasanduka wonyansa.

Anatumiza moto wocokera kumwamba kulowa m'mafupa anga, unawagonjetsa;
Wachera mapazi anga ukonde, wandibwezera m'mbuyo;
Wandipululutsa ndi kundilefula tsiku lonse.

Gori la zolakwa zanga lamangidwa ndi dzanja lace;
Zalukidwa, zakwera pakhosi panga; iye wakhumudwitsa mphamvuyanga;
Ambuye wandipereka m'manja mwao, sindithai kuwalaka.

Ambuye wapepula ngwazi zanga zonse pakati panga;
Waitanira msonkhano pa ine kuti uphwanye anyamata anga,
Ambuye wapondereza namwaliyo, mwana wamkazi wa Ziyoni, monga mopondera mphesa.

Cifukwa ca zimenezi ndilira; diso langa, diso langatu likudza madzi:
Pakuti wonditonthoza, wotsitsimutsa moyo wanga, anditarikira;
Ana anga asungulumwa, pakuti adaniwo apambana.

Ziyoni atambasula manja ace, palibe wakumtonthoza;
Yehova walamulira kuti omzungulira Yakobo akhale adani ace;
Yerusalemu wasanduka cinthu conyansa pakati pao.

Yehova ali wolungama; pakuti ndapikisana ndi m'kamwa mwace:
Mudtvetu, mitundu ya anthu nonsenu, nimuone cisoni canga;
Anamwali ndi anyamata anga atha kulowa m'ndende.

Ndinaitanaakundikondawokoma anandinyenga;
Ansembe ndi akulu anga anamwalira m'mudzimu,
Alikufunafuna zakudya zotsitsimutsa miyoyo yao.

Onani, Yehova; pakuti ndabvutika, m'kati mwanga mugwedezeka;
Mtima wanga wasanduka mwa ine; pakuti ndapikisana nanu ndithu;
Kunjako lupanga limangopha ana; m'nyumba muli imfa.

Iwo anamva kuti ndiusa moyo, palibe wonditonthoza;
Adani anga onse atha kumva msauko wanga, nakondwera kuti mwatero ndinu;
Mudzafikitsa tsiku lija mwalichula, ndipo iwowo adzanga ine.

2:
Ambuye waphimbatu ndi mtambo mwana wamkazi wa Ziyoni, pomkwiyira!
Wagwetsa pansi kucokera kumwamba kukoma kwace kwa Israyeli;
Osakumbukira poponda mapazi ace tsiku la mkwiyo wace.

Yehova wameza nyumba zonse za Yakobo osazicitira cisoni;
Wagumula malinga a mwana wamkazi wa Yuda mwa ukali wace;
Wawagwetsera pansi, waipitsa ufumuwo ndi akalonga ace.

Pokwiya moopsya walikha nyanga zonse za Israyeli;
Wabweza m'mbuyo dzanja lace lamanja pamaso pa adaniwo,
Natentha Yakobo ngati moto wamalawi wonyambita mozungulira.

Wathifula uta wace ngati mdani, waima ndi dzanja lace lamanja ngati mmaliwongo;
Wapha onse okondweretsa maso;
Watsanulira ukali wace ngati moto pa hema wa mwana wamkazi wa Ziyoni.

Yehova wasanduka mdani, wameza Israyeli;
Wameza zinyumba zace zonse, wapasula malinga ace;
Nacurukitsira mwana wamkazi wa Yuda maliro ndi cibumo.

Wacotsa mwamphamvu dindiro lace ngati la m'munda;
Waononga mosonkhanira mwace;
Yehova waiwalitsa anthu msonkhano ndi sabata m'Ziyoni;
Wanyoza mfumu ndi wansembe mokwiya mwaukali.

Ambuye wataya guwa lace la nsembe, malo ace opatulika amnyansira;
Wapereka m'manja a adani ace makoma a zinyumba zace;
Iwo anaphokosera m'nyumba ya Yehova ngati tsiku la msonkhano.

Yehova watsimikiza mtima kupasula linga la mwana wamkazi wa Ziyoni;
Watambalika cingwe, osabweza dzanja lace kuti lisaonongepo;
Waliritsa chemba ndi linga; zilefuka pamodzi.

Zipata zace zalowa pansi; waononga ndi kutyola mipiringidzo yace;
Mfumu yace ndi akalonga ace ali pakati pa amitundu akusowa cilamulo;
Inde, aneneri ace samalandira masomphenya kwa Yehova.

Akulu a mwana wamkazi wa Ziyoni akhala pansi natonthola;
Aponya pfumbi pa mitu yao, namangirira ciguduli m'cuuno mwao:
Anamwali a ku Yerusalemu aweramitsa pansi mitu yao.

Maso anga alefuka ndi misozi, m'kati mwanga mugwedezeka;
Ciwindi canga cagwa pansi cifukwa ca kupasuka kwa mwana wamkazi wa anthu amtundu wanga;
Cifukwa tiana ndi oyamwa akomoka m'makwalala a mudziwu.

Aneneri ako anakuonera masomphenya acabe ndi opusa;
Osaulula mphulupulu yako kuti abweze undende wako,
Koma anakuonera manenero acabe ndi opambutsa.

Yehova wacita comwe analingalira;
Watsiriza mau ace, amene analamulira nthawi yakale;
Wagwetsa osacitira cisoni;
Wakondweretsa adani pa iwe,
Wakweza nyanga ya amaliwongo ako.

Mtima wao unapfuula kwa Ambuye,
Linga iwe la mwana wamkazi wa Ziyoni, igwe misozi ngati mtsinje usana ndi usiku;
Usapume kanthawi, asaleke mwana wa diso lako.

Tauka, tapfuula usiku, poyamba kulonda;
Tsanulira mtima wako ngati madzi pamaso pa Ambuye;
Takwezera maso ako kwa Iye, cifukwa ca moyo wa tiana tako,
Timene tilefuka ndi njala pa malekezero a makwalala onse.

Wamng'ono ndi nkhalamba agona pansi m'makwalala;
Anamwali ndi anyamata anga agwa ndi lupanga;
Munawapha tsiku la mkwiyo wanu, munawagwaza osacitira cisoni.

Mwaitana zondiopsya mozungulira ngati tsiku la msonkhano;
Panalibe wopulumuka ndi wotsala tsiku la mkwiyo wa Yehova;
Omwe ndinawaseweza ndi kuwalera, adaniwo anawatsiriza.

Pakuti munandiponya mwakuya m'kati mwa nyanja,
Ndipo madzi anandizinga;
Mapfunde anu onse a nyondonyondo anandimiza.

Ndinatsikira ku matsinde a mapiri,
Mipingiridzo ya dziko inanditsekereza kosatha;
Koma munandikwezera moyo wanga kuucotsa kucionongeko, Yehova Mulungu wanga.

3:
Yehova, ndinamva mbiri yanu ndi mantha;
Yehova, tsitsimutsani nchito yanu pakati pa zaka,
Pakati pa zaka mudziwitse;
Pa mkwiyo mukumbukile cifundo.

Ndi kunyezimira kwace kunanga kuunika;
Anali nayo mitsitsi ya dzuwa yoturuka m'dzanja lace.
Ndi komweko kunabisika mphamvu yace.

Anaimirira, nandengulitsa dziko lapansi;
Anapenya, nanjenjemeretsa amitundu;
Ndi mapiri acikhalire anamwazika,
Zitunda za kale lomwe zinawerama;
Mayendedwe ace ndiwo a kale lomwe.

Munapombosola uta wanu;
Malumbiro analumbirira mafuko anali mau oona.
Munang'amba dziko lapansi ndi mitsinje.

Mapiri anakuonani, namva zawawa;
Cigumula ca madzi cinapita;
Madzi akuya anamveketsa mau ace,
Nakweza manja ace m'mwamba.

Dzuwa ndi mwezi zinaima njera mokhala mwao;
Pa kuunika kwa mibvi yanu popita iyo.
Pa kung'anipa kwa nthungo yanu yonyezimira.

Munapyoza ndi maluti ace mutu wa ankhondo ace;
Anadza ngati kabvumvulu kundimwaza;
Kukondwerera kwao kunanga kufuna kutha ozunzika mabisika.

Cinkana mkuyu suphuka,
Kungakhale kulibe zipatso kumpesa;
Yalephera nchito ya azitona,
Ndi m'minda m'mosapatsa cakudya;
Ndi zoweta zacotsedwa kukhola,
Palibenso ng'ombe m'makola mwao;

13:
Ndipo adzacitidwa kwa iwo mau adanenera Yesaya, amene ati.
Pakumva mudzamva, ndipo simudzazindikira konse;
Pakupenya mudzapenya, ndipo simudzaona konse;

kuti cikacitidwe conenedwa ndi mneneri, kuti,
Ndidzatsegula pakamwa panga ndi mafanizo;
Ndidzaulula zinthu zobisika ciyambire kukhazikidwa kwace kwa dziko lapansi.

1:
Monga mwalembedwa m'Yesaya mneneri,
Ona, ndituma mthenga wanga patsogolo pa nkhope yanu,
Amene adzakonza njira yanu;

12:
Kodi simunawerenga ngakhale lembo ili;
Mwala umene anaukana omanga nyumba,
Womwewu unayesedwa mutu wa pangondya:

3:
Cigwa ciri conse cidzadzazidwa,
Ndipo phiri liri lonse ndi mtunda uti wonse zidzacepsedwa;
Ndipo zokhota zidzakhala zolungama,
Ndipo njira za zigoloondo zidzakhala zosalala;

2:
Ndipo ndidzapatsa zodabwitsa m'thambo la kumwamba,
Ndi zizindikilo pa dziko lapansi;
Mwazi, ndi moto, ndi mpweya wautsi;

Pakuti Davine anena za Iye,
Ndinaona Mbuye pamaso panga nthawi zonse;
Cifukwa ali pa dzanja langa lamanja, kuti ndingasinthike;

8:
M'kucepetsedwa kwace ciweruzo cace cinacotsedwa;
Mbadwo wace adzaubukitsa ndani?
Cifukwa wacotsedwa kudziko moyo wace.

13:
7 Taona ni, opeputsa inu, zizwani, kanganukani;
Kuti ndigwiritsa nchito Ine masikuanu,
Nchito imene simudzaikhulupira wina akakuuzani.

15:
Zikatha izo ndidzabwera, Ndidzamanganso cihema ca Davine, cimene cinagwa;
Ndidzamanganso zopasuka zace,
Ndipo ndidzaciimikanso:

28:
ndi kuti,
Pita kwa anthu awa, nuti,
Ndi kumva mudzamva, ndipo simudzazindikira konse;
Ndipo pakupenya mudzapenya, koma osaona konse;

8:
Monganso kwalembedwa,
12 Cifukwa ca Inu tirikuphedwa dzuwa lonse;
Tinayesedwa monga nkhosa zakupha,

9:
Monga atinso mwa Hoseya,
Amene sanakhala anthu anga, ndidzawacha anthu anga;
Ndi iye amene sanali wokondedwa, wokondedwa.

monganso kwalembedwa, kuti,
8 Onani, ndikhazika m'Ziyoni mwala wakukhumudwa nao, ndi thanthwe lopunthwitsa;
Ndipo 9 wakukhulupirira iye sadzacita manyazi.

10:
Ndipo Yesaya alimbika mtima ndithu, nati,
Ndinapezedwa ndi iwo amene sanandifuna;
Ndinaonekera kwa iwo amene sanandifunsa.

11:
Ndipo Davide akuti,
Gome lao likhale kwa iwo, ngati msampha, ndi ngati diwa,
Ndi monga cokhumudwitsa, ndi cowabwezera cilango;

ndipo cotero Israyeli yense adzapulumuka; monganso kunalembedwa, kuti,
Adzaturuka ku Ziyoni Mpulumutsi;
Iye adzacotsa zamwano kwa Yakobo:

15:
Ndiponso,
Tamandani Ambuye, inu a mitundu yonse;
Ndipo anthu onse amtamande.

6:
(pakuti anena,
M'nyengo yolandiridwa ndinamva iwe,
Ndipo m'tsiku la cipulumutso ndinakuthandiza;
Taonani, tsopano ndiyo nyengo yabwino yolandiridwa, taonani, tsopano ndilo tsiku la cipulumutso);

9:
monga kwalembedwa;
Anabalalitsa, anapatsa kwa osauka;
Cilungamo cace cikhala ku nthawi yonse.

4:
Pakuti kwalembedwa,
Kondwera, cumba iwe wosabala;
Yimba nthungululu, nupfuule iwe wosamva kuwawa kwa kubala;
Pakuti ana ace a iye ali mbeta acuruka koposa ana a iye ali naye mwamuna.

1:
Ndipo za angelo anenadi,
Amene ayesa angelo ace mizimu,
Ndi omtumikira iye akhale lawi lamoto;

Koma ponena za Mwana, ati,
Mpando wacifumu wanu, Mulungu, ufikira nthawi za nthawi;
Ndipo ndodo yacifumu yoongoka ndiyo ndodo ya ufumu wanu.

Mwakonda cilungamo, ndi kudana naco coipa;
Mwa ici Mulungu, ndiye Mulungu wanu, wakudzozani
Ndi mafuta a cikondwerero ceni ceni koposa anzanu.

Ndipo,
Inu, Ambuye, paciyambipo munaika maziko ace a dziko,
Ndipo miyamba iri nchito ya manja anu;

2:
Munamcepsa pang'ono ndi angelo,
Mudambveka iye korona wa ulemerero ndi ulemu,
Ndipo mudamuika iye wovang'anira nchito za manja anu;

3:
Momwemo ndinakwiya nao mbadwouwu,
Ndipo ndinati, Nthawi zonse amasocera mumtima;
Koma sanazindikira njira zangaiwowa;

10:
ici ndi cipangano ndidzapangana nao,
Atapira masiku ajawo, anena Ambuye:
Ndidzapereka malamulo anga akhale pamtima pao;
Ndipo pa nzeru zao ndidzawalemba;

12:
ndipo mwaiwala dandauliro limene linena nanu monga ndi ana,
Mwana wanga, usayese copepuka kulanga kwa Ambuye,
Kapena usakomoke podzudzulidwa ndilye;

13:
Kotero kuti tinena molimbika mtima,
Mthandizi wanga ndiye Ambuye; smdidzaopa;
Adzandicitira ciani munthu?

2:
Cifukwa kwalembedwa m'lembo,
Taona, ndiika m'Ziyoni mwala wotsiriza wa pangondya, wosankhika, wa mtengo wace;
Ndipo wokhulupirira iye sadzanyazitsidwa.

Kwa inu tsono akukhulupira, ali wa mtengo wace; koma kwa iwo osakhulupira,
Mwala umene omangawo anaukana,
Womwewo unayesedwa mutu wa pangondya;

ndipo,
Mwala wakukhumudwa nao, ndi thanthwe lopunthwitsa;
kwa iwo akukhumudwa ndi mau, pokhala osamvera, kumenekonso adaikidwako.

3:
Pakuti maso a Ambuye ali pa olungama,
Ndi makutu ace akumva rembedzo lao;
Koma nkhope ya Ambuye iri pa ocita zoipa,
